{"id":"be44d5d262d8e4c8","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-edge-expanded-reduction.md","title":"继承边栈的唯一步与路径扩展","display":"df-edge-expanded-reduction — 继承边栈的唯一步与路径扩展","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction","aliases":["56-df-edge-expanded-reduction"],"display":"df-edge-expanded-reduction — 继承边栈的唯一步与路径扩展","depends_on":["[[56-df-edge-expanded-trs]]","[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]"],"source_section":"§8.6 Proposition 8.6.67; Definition 8.6.69","source_printed_pages":"411–412","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-edge-expanded-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-edge-expanded-reduction — 继承边栈的唯一步与路径扩展"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"805dfef75468c832\" href=\"?note=805dfef75468c832\" title=\"56-df-edge-expanded-trs\">56-df-edge-expanded-trs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Proposition 8.6.67; Definition 8.6.69"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"411–412"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"805dfef75468c832\" href=\"?note=805dfef75468c832\" title=\"56-df-edge-expanded-trs\">56-df-edge-expanded-trs</a> 的左线性系统与构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\operatorname{Red},\\operatorname{ctr}\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\operatorname{Red},\\operatorname{ctr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a> 的相应系统实例。EStep各式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(s,u,t),u=(p,l,r)\">\\(a=(s,u,t),u=(p,l,r)\\)</span> 是该式局部绑定的具体步变量，其参数域由断言显式给出；不对EPath的源项额外要求存在收缩步。有限路径、首尾端点、串接、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_X\">\\(\\mathbf1_X\\)</span> 及步投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a>，路径切片见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\\)</span>。下面的单值关系用函数值记法，输出是具体步而非仅目标项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EStep}_R\\coloneqq\\{(((s,(p,l,r),t),X),(X,(q,L,H),Y)):(s,(p,l,r),t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\ X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s),\\ (X,(q,L,H),Y)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\ \\pi_X(q)=p,\\ \\mathcal C(L)=l,\\ \\mathcal C(H)=r\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EStep}_R\\coloneqq\\{(((s,(p,l,r),t),X),(X,(q,L,H),Y)):(s,(p,l,r),t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\ X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s),\\ (X,(q,L,H),Y)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\ \\pi_X(q)=p,\\ \\mathcal C(L)=l,\\ \\mathcal C(H)=r\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\;\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\;\\exists! b\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e}\\;(((a,X),b)\\in\\operatorname{EStep}_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\;\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\;\\exists! b\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e}\\;(((a,X),b)\\in\\operatorname{EStep}_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{EStep}_R)=\\{(a,X):a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\ X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{EStep}_R)=\\{(a,X):a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\ X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\mathbf1_s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\mathbf1_s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle v\\rangle\\bigr);\\operatorname{EPath}_R(Y,\\rho[1:\\ell(\\rho)])\\quad(\\ell(\\rho)&gt;0,\\ (X,v,Y)=\\operatorname{EStep}_R(\\operatorname{step}_0(\\rho),X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle v\\rangle\\bigr);\\operatorname{EPath}_R(Y,\\rho[1:\\ell(\\rho)])\\quad(\\ell(\\rho)&gt;0,\\ (X,v,Y)=\\operatorname{EStep}_R(\\operatorname{step}_0(\\rho),X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{R^e},\\qquad\\ell(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))=\\ell(\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))=X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{R^e},\\qquad\\ell(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))=\\ell(\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))=X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho);\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)),\\eta)\\quad(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho);\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)),\\eta)\\quad(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho|_i)\\quad(0\\le i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho|_i)\\quad(0\\le i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对指定原步骤，在X中存在唯一的原函数顶点q塌缩到p。沿左项的函数位置读取X中相邻原函数之间完整的e栈，唯一确定展开左项L；每个左变量只出现一次，因此余下子树唯一确定展开替换。规则右项H已由原规则及是否collapsing唯一指定，替换和上下文确定Y。新生成右侧内部边至少含一个e；变量实例与上下文保留已有边栈，故Y仍是目标t的进一步扩展。这同时证明EStep的全定义域、单值性与输出合法性。</p>\n<p>EPath沿原路径长度递归；目标继续充当下一步的展开源。零步、拼接和前缀律由长度归纳成立。尤其在中途不重新取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(t)\">\\(\\mathcal E(t)\\)</span>，否则会丢弃已经积累的历史。规范一元EPath只是二元形式在初始展开源上的缩写。</p>\n<p>来源为原书命题8.6.67的实际证明；将其“唯一规则、上下文、替换”展开为明确的有限树构造，并按现有具体步接口保留收缩位置。未使用自动证明器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-edge-expanded-trs","status":"resolved","id":"805dfef75468c832","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-edge-expanded-trs]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-edge-expanded-trs","status":"resolved","id":"805dfef75468c832","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-trs]] 的左线性系统与构造。$\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\operatorname{Red},\\operatorname{ctr}$ 见 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]] 的相应系统实例。EStep各式中的 $a=(s,u,t),u=(p,l,r)$ 是该式局部绑定的具体步变量，其参数域由断言显式给出；不对EPath的源项额外要求存在收缩步。有限路径、首尾端点、串接、$\\mathbf1_X$ 及步投影见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]，路径切片见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]；$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$i\\in\\mathbb N$，$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$。下面的单值关系用函数值记法，输出是具体步而非仅目标项。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-trs]] 的左线性系统与构造。$\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\operatorname{Red},\\operatorname{ctr}$ 见 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]] 的相应系统实例。EStep各式中的 $a=(s,u,t),u=(p,l,r)$ 是该式局部绑定的具体步变量，其参数域由断言显式