x":"\\operatorname{EStep}_R\\coloneqq\\{(((s,(p,l,r),t),X),(X,(q,L,H),Y)):(s,(p,l,r),t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\ X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s),\\ (X,(q,L,H),Y)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e},\\ \\pi_X(q)=p,\\ \\mathcal C(L)=l,\\ \\mathcal C(H)=r\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\;\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\;\\exists! b\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R^e}\\;(((a,X),b)\\in\\operatorname{EStep}_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{EStep}_R)=\\{(a,X):a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\ X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\mathbf1_s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle v\\rangle\\bigr);\\operatorname{EPath}_R(Y,\\rho[1:\\ell(\\rho)])\\quad(\\ell(\\rho)>0,\\ (X,v,Y)=\\operatorname{EStep}_R(\\operatorname{step}_0(\\rho),X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),\\rho).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)\\in\\mathcal F_{R^e},\\qquad\\ell(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))=\\ell(\\rho),\\qquad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))=X.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho;\\eta)=\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho);\\operatorname{EPath}_R(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)),\\eta)\\quad(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho)|_i=\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho|_i)\\quad(0\\le i\\le\\ell(\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(t)","display":false}],"bytes":4016,"backlinks":[{"id":"803b6c844379847d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]] 的左线性系统，$R^e$ 为边扩展规则，$T^e$ 为扩展项集。$\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}$、$\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{InfRed}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)$，路径前缀、步及端点见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]。$\\pi_2(s,u,t)=u$ 为三元组的第二投影。$\\operatorname{EPath}_R$ 见 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]]，标记提升的前缀一致性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]；$\\mathcal I_{R^e}^{\\mathrm L}$ 是 [[56-df-levy-family-development]] 在扩展系统上的合法无限标记步接口。$\\operatorname{erase}_L,\\operatorname{LStep}_{R^e}$ 均取展开系统的Lévy实例。下面构造的函数仅在上述合法无限路径域上定义。"},{"id":"9618eeaafca311ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]] 的左线性系统、$\\mathcal E,R^e,\\mathcal C,\\operatorname{Exp},\\operatorname{Rep},\\operatorname{epos},\\operatorname{Vis}$。标记项、原子符号 $A$、复杂符号 $C$、子标签关系 $\\operatorname{SubLabel}$、擦除 $\\operatorname{erase}_L$ 见 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]；路径提升及合法性见 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。这些标签构造以下均实例化于 $R^e$。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$；$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$；$M\\in T_{R^e}^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(M)=X$；$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)),w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$；$i\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"c220c3da3b337585","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction]] 的左线性系统和任意 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$、$X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$；$Y=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))$。$\\operatorname{Tr}^m$ 与 $\\operatorname{wit}$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]，分别实例化于原系统及展开系统。$m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}$，$z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))$，$w\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$；代表集合的合法性见 [[56-prop-edge-expansion-preservation]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-edge-expanded-reduction.md]]"},{"id":"94c9aea947b97724","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数